h a tree equal to `41abb32c4766cb5434a7e54281f3e98c6c754153` while main is unmoved (else explain by what main moved), its diff against main exactly the 12 paths, equal to `pulls/89/files` by GET; control: a scratch branch in your clone with one line of `DEPLOY.md` changed at base line 432 conflicts (rc 1, listing). The ORDER against PR #88: re-intersect NOW by GET (counts 12 and 3, controls: a planted shared path is found, self-compares list 12 and 3), then both orders in your clone on scratch branches (`main`+89 then +88; `main`+88 then +89): clean or conflict, final trees identical and equal to the union (15 paths against main), the squash of either alone leaves the other mergeable; neither PR changes a lockfile or `package.json` (one image serves every tree). If #88's head moved, use the head at your read and say which.
